# Kohana
We use a framework called Kohana (http://kohanaframework.org).
All files within the "system" folder are part of the framework and you should
never modify these files because they might get overwritten when switching to
a newer Kohana version. Instead you should rely on the "cascading filesystem"
feature which allows to customize almost all components. Please refer to the
Kohana user guide for more details.

You can run some sanity checks by renaming _install.php to install.php.
Make sure the directories application/cache and application/logs are writable!

# Database scheme
There is a sql scheme : table.sql (maybe it needs updates, in that case, just
tell me).
Copy config-base.php to config.php and edit the file manually.
